# Keep the build context small and host-only artefacts out of the image.
# `node_modules` especially: the host's are Windows symlinks into pnpm's store
# and are meaningless inside a Linux container.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.env
**/.env
apps/web/dist
apps/api/dist
